{"id":"6677ed9a9db25aca","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-cor-continental.md","title":"Continental Corollary","display":"cor-continental — Continental Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-continental","aliases":["58-cor-continental"],"display":"cor-continental — Continental Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-continental"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-continental</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-continental — Continental Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b88f95029c0e7f0\" href=\"?note=0b88f95029c0e7f0\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md\">../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"158e8447c69f47ed\" href=\"?note=158e8447c69f47ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{c}=2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\mathfrak{c}=2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> (continuum cardinal)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak d)\">\\(\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\)</span> (dominating number, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0b88f95029c0e7f0\" href=\"?note=0b88f95029c0e7f0\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md\">../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\\)</span> (splitting number, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"158e8447c69f47ed\" href=\"?note=158e8447c69f47ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md\">../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continental} \\vdash \\bigl(\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\\land \\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak d\\leq\\mathfrak c\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak s\\leq\\mathfrak c\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}continental} \\vdash \\bigl(\\mathrm{DominatingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak d)\\land \\mathrm{ZfcCiSplittingNumber}_S(\\mathfrak s)\\land \\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\bigr)\\to\\bigl(\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak d\\leq\\mathfrak c\\land\\omega_1\\leq\\mathfrak s\\leq\\mathfrak c\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Dominating and splitting numbers are at least <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Their exact values are independent of ZFC.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"0b88f95029c0e7f0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-dominating-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md","status":"resolved","id":"158e8447c69f47ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-splitting-number.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/5